<h1>New sign-in to your account</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
<p>Your <strong>{{appName}}</strong> account was accessed from a device we don't recognize:</p>
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="8" style="margin:16px 0;border-collapse:collapse;">
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#6b7280;">When</td>
    <td><strong>{{when}}</strong></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#6b7280;">Device</td>
    <td><strong>{{device}}</strong></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#6b7280;">IP</td>
    <td><strong>{{ip}}</strong></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p>If it was you, no action is needed.</p>
<p><strong>Wasn't you?</strong> End that session, change your password and turn on two-step verification.</p>
{{> button url=securityUrl label="Review my sessions"}}
